    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49924" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ursīnus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a bear</i>, <i>bear's-.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sanguis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					Arb. 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fel,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					28, 16, 62, § 219</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adeps,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					28, 17, 71, § 235</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rabies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					36, 54, § 130</span></i>
			: allium, <i>a kind of wild garlic</i>, id.  19, 6, 34, § 116.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ursīna</span></b> , ae, f., <i>bear's meat</i>, <i><span class="en">Petr.
			66</span></i>.</div>
